  <header>
    <p>The missing map</p>
    <h2 id="submerged-record-title">Some of the record is under water</h2>
    <span>Present coastlines are recent boundaries. During glacial low stands, people occupied land that now lies beneath continental-shelf seas.</span>
  </header>
  <div class="cross-section" role="img" aria-label="Schematic cross section showing a modern sea above a former land surface with artifacts, and a present shoreline at the right">
